  "prefLabel": "Env-A 204.02 Hearing Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 204.02 Hearing Procedures. Public hearings requested or required pursuant to the SIP shall be conducted in accordance with the provisions of Env-C 200 applicable to non-adjudicatory public hearings.\n\nSource. #10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
